{
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "stem_md": "曲面 $x^2-2y^2+z^2-xyz-4x+2z=6$ 在点 $(0,1,2)$ 处的切平面方程为。",
  "options_json": [
    {
      "key": "opt_1",
      "content_md": "$3(x-1)+2(y-2)-3z+11=0$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_2",
      "content_md": "$\\frac x3=\\frac{y-1}2=\\frac{z-2}{-3}$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_3",
      "content_md": "$3x+2y-3z=4$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_4",
      "content_md": "$\\frac x3+\\frac{y-1}2+\\frac{z-2}{-3}=0$"
    }
  ],
  "answer_json": {
    "option_keys": [
      "opt_1"
    ]
  },
  "analysis_md": "设 $F(x,y,z)=x^2-2y^2+z^2-xyz-4x+2z-6$，则\n\n$$F_x(0,1,2)=2x-yz-4=-6,\\quad F_y(0,1,2)=-4y-xz=-4,\\quad F_z(0,1,2)=2z-xy+2=6,$$\n\n曲面在点 $(0,1,2)$ 处的切平面方程为：$-6x-4(y-1)+6(z-2)=0$，整理得：\n\n$$3(x-1)+2(y-2)-3z+11=0.$$",
  "search_text": "曲面 $x^2-2y^2+z^2-xyz-4x+2z=6$ 在点 $(0,1,2)$ 处的切平面方程为。 $3(x-1)+2(y-2)-3z+11=0$ $\\frac x3=\\frac{y-1}2=\\frac{z-2}{-3}$ $3x+2y-3z=4$ $\\frac x3+\\frac{y-1}2+\\frac{z-2}{-3}=0$ 设 $F(x,y,z)=x^2-2y^2+z^2-xyz-4x+2z-6$，则\n\n$$F_x(0,1,2)=2x-yz-4=-6,\\quad F_y(0,1,2)=-4y-xz=-4,\\quad F_z(0,1,2)=2z-xy+2=6,$$\n\n曲面在点 $(0,1,2)$ 处的切平面方程为：$-6x-4(y-1)+6(z-2)=0$，整理得：\n\n$$3(x-1)+2(y-2)-3z+11=0.$$",
  "sort_order": 28
